worklog (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New `worklog view --year [this|last|YYYY]` to see monthly totals for a
    whole year, with `--summary` for totals only.
  * New `worklog year` shortcut that opens the year view and can build the
    yearly report (`--report`) or PowerPoint deck (`--ppt`).
  * Document the year view and the shortcut.

